1
00:00:01,793 --> 00:00:05,088
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:14,764
[laughs]

3
00:00:32,782 --> 00:00:37,162
[Helena] <i>I will not allow someone</i>
<i>like Lily Cruz to slander me.</i>

4
00:00:37,245 --> 00:00:39,706
<i>This Lily Cruz just did it.</i>

5
00:00:39,789 --> 00:00:41,916
[Jude] <i>Helena Montoya,</i>
<i>you are under arrest</i>

6
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,835
<i>for arms trafficking</i>
<i>and human trafficking.</i>

7
00:00:43,918 --> 00:00:44,836
<i>Come with us.</i>

8
00:00:44,919 --> 00:00:46,337
<i>-Wait!</i>
<i>-Let go of me! Don't touch me!</i>

9
00:00:46,421 --> 00:00:47,714
[Emilia] <i>You can't do this to my mama!</i>

10
00:00:47,797 --> 00:00:49,716
[Julio] <i>The mother and her daughter,</i>

11
00:00:49,799 --> 00:00:53,845
<i>both taken down by a wildflower.</i>

12
00:00:53,928 --> 00:00:56,264
<i>Looks like you have</i>
<i>something planned for Lily Cruz.</i>

13
00:00:56,347 --> 00:00:57,557
<i>I am above the law.</i>

14
00:00:57,640 --> 00:00:59,642
<i>No, wait. I am the law.</i>

15
00:00:59,726 --> 00:01:03,313
<i>And that Lily Cruz just declared</i>
<i>a full-fledged war</i>

16
00:01:03,396 --> 00:01:04,981
<i>against Red Dragon.</i>

17
00:01:05,065 --> 00:01:07,859
[Diego] <i>Whatever it is you're planning</i>
<i>to help Red Dragon escape,</i>

18
00:01:07,942 --> 00:01:10,195
<i>I'll make sure it fails.</i>

19
00:01:10,278 --> 00:01:12,363
<i>I know what Red Dragon is capable of.</i>

20
00:01:12,447 --> 00:01:16,618
<i>Red Dragon's claws dig in deep,</i>
<i>enough so to infiltrate the NBI.</i>

21
00:01:16,701 --> 00:01:18,161
<i>What are you hiding from me?</i>

22
00:01:18,244 --> 00:01:20,872
<i>Why don't you just forget</i>
<i>about everything, Arnaldo?!</i>

23
00:01:20,955 --> 00:01:23,708
<i>It won't do you or any of us any good!</i>

24
00:01:23,792 --> 00:01:27,921
<i>Take this chance to start over.</i>
<i>Don't throw it away.</i>

25
00:01:28,004 --> 00:01:29,839
[Damian] <i>Red Dragon's</i>
<i>planning something big.</i>

26
00:01:29,923 --> 00:01:31,257
-[Helena cackling]
-[gunshot]

27
00:01:32,091 --> 00:01:33,927
[Diego] <i>Lily, get ready. She's on her way.</i>

28
00:01:34,010 --> 00:01:35,178
-[gunfire]
-<i>Hey!</i>

29
00:01:35,261 --> 00:01:36,137
[rapid gunfire]

30
00:01:36,221 --> 00:01:37,180
-[tires screeching]
-[engine revving]

31
00:01:37,263 --> 00:01:39,307
[chopper blades whirring]

32
00:01:46,689 --> 00:01:48,691
[blades whirring]

33
00:01:49,234 --> 00:01:52,237
[intense music playing]

34
00:02:12,090 --> 00:02:13,800
[chopper blades whirring]

35
00:02:21,015 --> 00:02:23,852
[Helena taunting]

36
00:02:26,146 --> 00:02:27,647
[Helena laughing]

37
00:02:28,481 --> 00:02:29,482
[gunfire]

38
00:02:35,822 --> 00:02:37,782
-[Helena keeps laughing]
-[Lily grunting in frustration]

39
00:02:37,866 --> 00:02:39,409
-Let's go!
-Move! Move!

40
00:02:40,827 --> 00:02:41,995
[yells]

41
00:02:45,456 --> 00:02:46,541
[yelling]

42
00:02:49,586 --> 00:02:52,547
This isn't over, Helena!

43
00:03:00,305 --> 00:03:01,055
[panting]

44
00:03:08,938 --> 00:03:10,315
[Lily] What happened?!

45
00:03:10,398 --> 00:03:13,401
Huh?! You just let her escape!

46
00:03:17,405 --> 00:03:18,823
She's gone!

47
00:03:23,453 --> 00:03:24,579
[Lily raging]

48
00:03:31,544 --> 00:03:32,587
[woman on TV] <i>Reports say</i>

49
00:03:32,670 --> 00:03:35,256
<i>an unidentified group</i>
<i>helped Red Dragon escape</i>

50
00:03:35,340 --> 00:03:39,761
<i>by whisking the syndicate leader away</i>
<i>aboard a helicopter.</i>

51
00:03:39,844 --> 00:03:43,973
<i>It seems Red Dragon outsmarted</i>
<i>the authorities yet again.</i>

52
00:03:44,057 --> 00:03:49,145
<i>Stay tuned for more updates</i>
<i>on this developing story.</i>

53
00:03:49,229 --> 00:03:52,106
<i>This is Jerika Panganiban reporting.</i>

54
00:03:53,233 --> 00:03:54,442
Where are you going?

55
00:03:55,860 --> 00:03:57,862
[tense music playing]

56
00:03:59,697 --> 00:04:00,990
You are not my boss.

57
00:04:01,532 --> 00:04:04,244
I don't need to report
my every move to you.

58
00:04:17,924 --> 00:04:20,593
[Jude] We need to establish
the chopper's exact location.

59
00:04:21,010 --> 00:04:25,848
And according to this,
it's bound to land in the Visayas.

60
00:04:26,391 --> 00:04:28,142
[Noel] Okay, track it down now.

61
00:04:28,643 --> 00:04:30,812
I'll trace the pickup that attacked us.

62
00:04:36,859 --> 00:04:38,444
[motorcycle engine revving]

63
00:04:41,281 --> 00:04:43,783
We shouldn't waste our time
looking for the pickup.

64
00:04:43,866 --> 00:04:46,703
We need to find the chopper
that picked up Red Dragon.

65
00:04:46,995 --> 00:04:48,746
We need to concentrate our forces.

66
00:04:50,540 --> 00:04:51,916
Agent Salonga's right.

67
00:04:53,042 --> 00:04:57,046
We need to find the pickup
that attacked us too.

68
00:04:58,673 --> 00:05:00,341
With all due respect, Miss Cruz,

69
00:05:00,758 --> 00:05:03,011
I'm not asking for your opinion.

70
00:05:03,261 --> 00:05:05,471
Can you please just let us do our job?

71
00:05:06,055 --> 00:05:07,932
With all due respect, agent,

72
00:05:08,349 --> 00:05:10,643
wasn't I the one who tipped you off?

73
00:05:11,144 --> 00:05:15,732
If you guys were competent,
I wouldn't need to interfere.

74
00:05:15,815 --> 00:05:17,734
The moment I sense you're messing up,

75
00:05:18,151 --> 00:05:22,864
you guys can bet I'll take
matters into my own hands.

76
00:05:23,906 --> 00:05:26,909
[tense music playing]

77
00:05:27,952 --> 00:05:29,162
Agent Salonga.

78
00:05:31,247 --> 00:05:33,249
Get moving. I'll be in touch.

79
00:05:36,919 --> 00:05:38,212
Men, let's move.

80
00:05:53,895 --> 00:05:55,521
[engine noise fading]

81
00:05:58,483 --> 00:06:01,694
Are there any updates
on Red Dragon's whereabouts?

82
00:06:01,778 --> 00:06:03,279
Negative, Mercedes.

83
00:06:04,113 --> 00:06:06,741
-And what was that?!
-[tense music playing]

84
00:06:07,158 --> 00:06:09,077
Someone else messed up the operation.

85
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,453
They weren't police.

86
00:06:11,079 --> 00:06:12,830
[Damian] A different group, Mercedes.

87
00:06:16,876 --> 00:06:19,045
And what's with that look, huh?

88
00:06:19,128 --> 00:06:20,129
You!

89
00:06:20,922 --> 00:06:23,132
You're the only one with the motive

90
00:06:23,216 --> 00:06:24,550
to sabotage the organization.

91
00:06:25,134 --> 00:06:26,844
You sent the chopper for your mother

92
00:06:26,928 --> 00:06:29,305
so the syndicate
would think of you as a hero.

93
00:06:29,388 --> 00:06:30,932
No! What?!

94
00:06:31,015 --> 00:06:34,102
This isn't a contest,
so just drop the act.

95
00:06:34,185 --> 00:06:35,728
Where is Red Dragon?

96
00:06:35,812 --> 00:06:38,731
Excuse me, but I thought it was
you who helped Mama escape.

97
00:06:38,815 --> 00:06:41,150
You're trying to impress the syndicate

98
00:06:41,234 --> 00:06:43,444
because you want
to take Mama's place, right?

99
00:06:44,070 --> 00:06:46,906
You know, I was about to
applaud your chopper stunt.

100
00:06:46,989 --> 00:06:48,574
That was really brilliant.

101
00:06:48,658 --> 00:06:50,618
I didn't send the chopper.

102
00:06:50,701 --> 00:06:52,912
Okay. If neither of us was responsible,

103
00:06:52,995 --> 00:06:55,081
it could be the authorities, right?

104
00:06:55,164 --> 00:06:57,041
You know, instead of just standing there,

105
00:06:57,125 --> 00:06:58,918
you better go and look for her instead.

106
00:06:59,001 --> 00:07:00,878
That's your job, <i>remember?</i>

107
00:07:00,962 --> 00:07:02,547
Don't just stand there.

108
00:07:04,006 --> 00:07:06,008
[tense music playing]

109
00:07:06,759 --> 00:07:08,803
[phone ringing]

110
00:07:10,847 --> 00:07:11,848
Hello?

111
00:07:17,770 --> 00:07:18,688
Yes.

112
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:21,691
Mhm. Yes.

113
00:07:26,571 --> 00:07:27,572
[Mercedes] Okay.

114
00:07:36,998 --> 00:07:39,000
[pensive music playing]

115
00:07:50,595 --> 00:07:55,975
Red Dragon escaped.
I was so close, but I lost her.

116
00:08:01,898 --> 00:08:03,274
Diego, I'm sorry.

117
00:08:05,651 --> 00:08:07,695
I'm sorry, but the fight isn't over.

118
00:08:08,529 --> 00:08:10,990
I'll still need your help.

119
00:08:16,078 --> 00:08:18,080
[suspenseful music playing]

120
00:08:20,041 --> 00:08:24,795
Okay. I'll talk to my partners
right away. Goodbye.

121
00:08:26,422 --> 00:08:28,883
-Who was that?
-Is that about Mama?

122
00:08:29,759 --> 00:08:31,969
The Big Four want to set a meeting.

123
00:08:32,303 --> 00:08:33,971
[ominous music playing]

124
00:08:35,056 --> 00:08:38,518
Huh? Big Four? And who the hell are they?

125
00:08:38,601 --> 00:08:40,478
Were they the ones who helped
Red Dragon escape?

126
00:08:40,853 --> 00:08:42,605
We'll find out once they get here.

127
00:08:42,688 --> 00:08:45,399
So be on high alert. I will update you.

128
00:08:45,483 --> 00:08:46,901
Wait. I'm asking.

129
00:08:46,984 --> 00:08:48,569
Who are the Big Four?

130
00:08:51,030 --> 00:08:52,031
What's your deal?

131
00:08:53,115 --> 00:08:54,742
Who are they?!

132
00:08:56,953 --> 00:09:00,206
The four of them each lead
Red Dragon's operations

133
00:09:00,289 --> 00:09:02,959
in the north, south, east,
and west areas of the country.

134
00:09:03,668 --> 00:09:07,171
You mean to say,
my mother's scope is nationwide?

135
00:09:07,964 --> 00:09:09,006
Not just nationwide.

136
00:09:09,090 --> 00:09:11,842
You'd be surprised if I told you how far.

137
00:09:13,761 --> 00:09:15,763
[suspenseful music playing]

138
00:09:16,639 --> 00:09:17,473
Wow.

139
00:09:28,734 --> 00:09:31,362
[brooding music playing]

140
00:09:31,904 --> 00:09:33,489
Lily, here have a drink.

141
00:09:34,407 --> 00:09:37,076
The sooner I find out
who helped her escape,

142
00:09:37,159 --> 00:09:41,038
the sooner I can find
where Red Dragon is hiding.

143
00:09:42,665 --> 00:09:44,875
Mom, what I'm worried
about right now is Diego.

144
00:09:44,959 --> 00:09:47,503
He wasn't able to escape
from the syndicate.

145
00:09:47,587 --> 00:09:52,258
I'm the reason he's in there.
I should've done something…

146
00:09:53,634 --> 00:09:56,262
so he can escape while he still can.

147
00:09:57,013 --> 00:09:59,307
[Camia] It was Diego's decision
to help you.

148
00:09:59,390 --> 00:10:02,018
Don't shoulder all of the blame for this.

149
00:10:04,186 --> 00:10:06,314
Diego will get out.

150
00:10:07,982 --> 00:10:10,109
And we will be together.

151
00:10:11,819 --> 00:10:13,154
I swear it.

152
00:10:23,456 --> 00:10:24,707
-Papa.
-Hmm?

153
00:10:26,167 --> 00:10:27,251
I cannot believe this.

154
00:10:27,335 --> 00:10:29,503
Mama is gone and you're not
doing anything about it.

155
00:10:29,587 --> 00:10:31,505
How can you not do anything, Papa?

156
00:10:31,589 --> 00:10:33,966
Have you forgotten that she's my mother?

157
00:10:34,050 --> 00:10:35,593
You're not even the least bit worried.

158
00:10:37,011 --> 00:10:40,139
Your mother is supposed to be a dragon.

159
00:10:40,222 --> 00:10:43,476
You don't have to worry.
She won't let the police

160
00:10:43,976 --> 00:10:47,855
or Lily Cruz or anybody
catch her that easily.

161
00:10:47,938 --> 00:10:49,273
You know what you should do?

162
00:10:49,357 --> 00:10:54,111
You should focus on your…
little organization.

163
00:10:54,195 --> 00:10:55,112
[sighs]

164
00:10:55,196 --> 00:11:00,534
And, by the way, I heard that there's
a vacuum of power in your group.

165
00:11:02,495 --> 00:11:03,496
Why don't you grab it?

166
00:11:03,579 --> 00:11:06,207
Who knows? That might be your forte.

167
00:11:06,290 --> 00:11:08,334
It's not time yet, Papa.
The Big Four's still there.

168
00:11:08,417 --> 00:11:10,878
They are the heads of Mama's operations

169
00:11:10,961 --> 00:11:14,131
in the south, north, east,
and west of the Philippines.

170
00:11:14,215 --> 00:11:15,424
They're lined up for that.

171
00:11:15,508 --> 00:11:17,718
Besides, I still have other business.

172
00:11:18,677 --> 00:11:19,678
Like what?

173
00:11:20,554 --> 00:11:23,015
I will fumigate Mama's office,
to rid it of a bug.

174
00:11:23,099 --> 00:11:25,142
A bug named Mercedes.

175
00:11:25,976 --> 00:11:29,188
Good grief, Emilia. There you go again.

176
00:11:29,271 --> 00:11:30,773
This is exactly your problem.

177
00:11:30,856 --> 00:11:35,903
[stammering] You don't know
what to prioritize in your life

178
00:11:35,986 --> 00:11:37,822
and in everything that you do.

179
00:11:38,614 --> 00:11:42,410
Listen, in politics, even…

180
00:11:42,493 --> 00:11:46,539
unfortunately, in syndicates
and criminal organizations,

181
00:11:46,622 --> 00:11:49,834
that is a no-no. You have
to know your priorities.

182
00:11:51,085 --> 00:11:52,670
That's why you, Emilia,

183
00:11:53,671 --> 00:11:55,631
no matter where you find yourself…

184
00:11:56,298 --> 00:12:00,302
chances are you're bound to fail.

185
00:12:03,389 --> 00:12:05,808
[footsteps fading]

186
00:12:11,313 --> 00:12:12,273
-Diego.
-Lily.

187
00:12:14,817 --> 00:12:15,818
I'm sorry.

188
00:12:16,819 --> 00:12:19,071
I'm sorry I put you in this situation.

189
00:12:19,155 --> 00:12:20,364
And now the battle's still not over

190
00:12:20,448 --> 00:12:22,908
because that wretched dragon
managed to escape.

191
00:12:22,992 --> 00:12:26,787
-[breathes shakily]
-Lily, I'm there because I need to be.

192
00:12:28,372 --> 00:12:29,874
I know that.

193
00:12:29,957 --> 00:12:31,500
But I don't want this anymore.

194
00:12:31,584 --> 00:12:35,504
You have to leave
Red Dragon's camp. Please.

195
00:12:35,588 --> 00:12:38,340
I can help more from the inside,
and you know that.

196
00:12:38,424 --> 00:12:41,135
I can monitor Emilia
and Mercedes' every move.

197
00:12:41,218 --> 00:12:43,554
It'll be easier for us
to hunt down Red Dragon.

198
00:12:44,221 --> 00:12:45,264
It might.

199
00:12:45,347 --> 00:12:49,185
But, Diego, what if they catch you?

200
00:12:50,227 --> 00:12:52,271
[tender music playing]

201
00:12:52,354 --> 00:12:55,983
I'd rather die for a cause
than live without--

202
00:12:56,066 --> 00:12:59,403
[shushes] Diego, no.

203
00:13:00,404 --> 00:13:01,489
I won't allow this.

204
00:13:01,572 --> 00:13:05,784
We can win this fight without
anyone getting hurt, caught,

205
00:13:05,868 --> 00:13:08,370
or, most importantly, killed.
Do you understand?

206
00:13:09,121 --> 00:13:12,541
So while you're still in Red Dragon's den,

207
00:13:13,334 --> 00:13:15,794
nothing bad must happen to you, Diego.

208
00:13:18,839 --> 00:13:20,090
Promise me that.

209
00:13:21,884 --> 00:13:23,010
I promise.

210
00:13:24,512 --> 00:13:26,222
I will never leave you.

211
00:13:36,023 --> 00:13:39,652
[radio] <i>An unidentified group</i>
<i>helped Red Dragon escape</i>

212
00:13:39,735 --> 00:13:43,864
<i>by whisking the syndicate</i>
<i>leader away aboard a helicopter.</i>

213
00:13:43,948 --> 00:13:47,785
<i>It seems Red Dragon outsmarted</i>
<i>the authorities yet again.</i>

214
00:13:48,410 --> 00:13:51,205
<i>Stay tuned for more updates--</i>

215
00:13:52,581 --> 00:13:55,543
The bad news keeps piling up.
It's getting really old.

216
00:13:56,210 --> 00:13:58,921
How come, those who fight
for what's right are the ones

217
00:13:59,004 --> 00:14:01,006
who get deprived
of their right to be happy?

218
00:14:01,090 --> 00:14:02,466
To be with their loved ones?

219
00:14:02,967 --> 00:14:04,969
Diego and Lily are strong.

220
00:14:06,428 --> 00:14:08,430
They can get past any challenge
they might face.

221
00:14:08,889 --> 00:14:11,475
That's why you shouldn't worry
too much about them, love.

222
00:14:12,101 --> 00:14:13,978
I'll help them in any way I can.

223
00:14:17,481 --> 00:14:20,109
Honestly, love, we are so lucky.

224
00:14:20,734 --> 00:14:22,570
Despite all the chaos here in Ardiente,

225
00:14:22,653 --> 00:14:26,282
we're still together.
I'm so lucky I have you.

226
00:14:28,534 --> 00:14:30,327
I'm the lucky one, love.

227
00:14:31,871 --> 00:14:34,582
All right now. I have to go.

228
00:14:35,457 --> 00:14:37,167
-To take Arnaldo home?
-Yes.

229
00:14:37,251 --> 00:14:39,962
Anna, Jepoy, I'll do it.
I'm leaving anyway.

230
00:14:40,379 --> 00:14:41,422
Arnaldo?

231
00:14:41,881 --> 00:14:42,756
Arnaldo.

232
00:14:43,048 --> 00:14:44,758
[ominous music playing]

233
00:14:46,135 --> 00:14:48,012
Hey. He's not here.

234
00:14:49,305 --> 00:14:50,306
Arnaldo?

235
00:14:55,686 --> 00:14:57,021
Where did he go?

236
00:15:01,650 --> 00:15:02,568
[crickets chirping]

237
00:15:04,653 --> 00:15:07,990
By the way, the pickup
truck that attacked us

238
00:15:08,073 --> 00:15:09,825
and helped Red Dragon escape…

239
00:15:10,618 --> 00:15:12,077
I just know…

240
00:15:12,161 --> 00:15:16,498
that's how we'll unmask
whoever is helping Helena.

241
00:15:17,041 --> 00:15:19,585
It'll lead us to wherever she's hiding.

242
00:15:20,085 --> 00:15:22,504
Diego, someone needs to go back there.

243
00:15:23,964 --> 00:15:25,299
Leave it to me.

244
00:15:27,134 --> 00:15:28,510
Thank you, Diego.

245
00:15:28,677 --> 00:15:30,262
[dramatic music playing]

246
00:15:30,846 --> 00:15:32,348
Just hang in there.

247
00:15:35,100 --> 00:15:37,102
[tense music playing]

248
00:15:46,820 --> 00:15:48,405
Damian, have some coffee.

249
00:15:49,531 --> 00:15:50,324
Um…

250
00:15:51,075 --> 00:15:53,327
Camia, I'm sorry if I have to leave.

251
00:15:54,954 --> 00:15:57,873
Well, I'm in no position
to stop you from leaving.

252
00:15:58,499 --> 00:16:00,417
Besides, you have your own life to live.

253
00:16:01,210 --> 00:16:04,338
By the way, thanks for the tip
you gave to Lily.

254
00:16:05,214 --> 00:16:08,050
Too bad Red Dragon
was still able to escape

255
00:16:08,968 --> 00:16:10,886
after all that she did.

256
00:16:13,222 --> 00:16:15,975
Some group helped her escape,
and it wasn't Red Dragon's.

257
00:16:16,350 --> 00:16:17,768
How can you tell?

258
00:16:17,851 --> 00:16:19,979
[slow tense music playing]

259
00:16:20,437 --> 00:16:21,981
Well, it's just a hunch.

260
00:16:22,940 --> 00:16:25,818
Red Dragon's got a lot of connections

261
00:16:25,901 --> 00:16:27,695
that's why she's so elusive.

262
00:16:27,778 --> 00:16:31,240
After all these years, this is
the first time she got caught.

263
00:16:31,991 --> 00:16:33,617
All because of Lily.

264
00:16:35,369 --> 00:16:39,748
Damian, who told you
about Red Dragon's plan?

265
00:16:40,708 --> 00:16:42,042
Who gave you the tip?

266
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:46,005
Maybe that person could
help us chase her down.

267
00:16:46,839 --> 00:16:47,673
No one.

268
00:16:48,632 --> 00:16:49,633
I just…

269
00:16:50,384 --> 00:16:54,555
I just heard it from friends
who have connections.

270
00:16:56,015 --> 00:16:58,100
But they've changed for the better.

271
00:17:01,103 --> 00:17:02,187
Like you?

272
00:17:03,439 --> 00:17:04,189
Yes.

273
00:17:05,399 --> 00:17:09,403
Damian, thank you for helping Lily,

274
00:17:10,320 --> 00:17:13,866
but I hope your friends
won't be a bad influence

275
00:17:13,949 --> 00:17:16,535
or prevent you from leading a decent life.

276
00:17:18,704 --> 00:17:19,830
Thanks, Camia.

277
00:17:20,372 --> 00:17:23,208
[tense music playing]

278
00:17:25,252 --> 00:17:27,463
Is everything ready for the Big Four?

279
00:17:28,005 --> 00:17:29,673
Everything's ready, Mercedes.

280
00:17:30,340 --> 00:17:32,801
[Mercedes] What's the
latest update on Red Dragon?

281
00:17:32,885 --> 00:17:35,054
We've retrieved the pickup
truck that rescued her.

282
00:17:35,137 --> 00:17:36,805
It's been secured downstairs.

283
00:17:37,056 --> 00:17:38,974
Right now, we're tracking down its owner.

284
00:17:39,725 --> 00:17:41,560
Good. Keep me updated.

285
00:17:42,311 --> 00:17:45,272
[suspenseful music playing]

286
00:17:56,033 --> 00:17:57,201
Hmm…

287
00:17:58,619 --> 00:18:01,789
Mama is such an evil genius, you know.

288
00:18:01,872 --> 00:18:05,167
I have a feeling
she orchestrated her escape.

289
00:18:06,251 --> 00:18:07,336
You're right.

290
00:18:07,586 --> 00:18:09,922
I won't be surprised
if she planned all this out.

291
00:18:10,005 --> 00:18:11,840
She's Red Dragon, after all.

292
00:18:12,299 --> 00:18:14,885
So, I've decided not
to worry too much about it.

293
00:18:14,968 --> 00:18:19,056
Instead, I'll just prepare everything
for the queen's return.

294
00:18:19,556 --> 00:18:22,643
Well, that's not
your task to do. It's mine.

295
00:18:23,393 --> 00:18:27,564
[chuckles] Red Dragon breathes fire.

296
00:18:27,648 --> 00:18:29,274
You, on the other hand,

297
00:18:31,193 --> 00:18:34,029
breathe nothing more than hot air.

298
00:18:35,531 --> 00:18:38,826
Laugh now, Mercedes.
Laugh now all you want,

299
00:18:38,909 --> 00:18:43,372
because I'll be taking over
your position soon enough…

300
00:18:43,914 --> 00:18:45,332
I'm sure of that.

301
00:18:46,625 --> 00:18:47,709
[laptop shuts]

302
00:18:48,669 --> 00:18:49,878
You wish.

303
00:18:50,963 --> 00:18:52,965
[tense music playing]

304
00:18:59,721 --> 00:19:01,849
[ominous music plays]

305
00:19:01,932 --> 00:19:02,933
[grunts]

306
00:19:11,358 --> 00:19:12,109
Oh.

307
00:19:13,235 --> 00:19:15,737
Arnaldo, my son. Where have you been?

308
00:19:18,323 --> 00:19:19,324
Uh…

309
00:19:21,869 --> 00:19:24,496
-I went back to the village.
-Mhm.

310
00:19:25,622 --> 00:19:27,958
I was hoping I'd find something…

311
00:19:28,709 --> 00:19:31,003
that would clear things up for me…

312
00:19:32,212 --> 00:19:33,380
but I didn't.

313
00:19:35,382 --> 00:19:38,302
And I don't know
why I keep coming back here.

314
00:19:39,928 --> 00:19:42,890
That goes without saying, Arnaldo.

315
00:19:43,891 --> 00:19:45,934
This is your home, after all.

316
00:19:47,853 --> 00:19:49,354
You know what, Arnaldo?

317
00:19:49,438 --> 00:19:50,397
[exhales]

318
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:52,482
I will help you get well.

319
00:19:53,859 --> 00:19:56,028
And once you've fully recovered,

320
00:19:56,987 --> 00:20:01,408
I swear you'll forget about that village

321
00:20:01,491 --> 00:20:03,577
and all the people you were with.

322
00:20:05,370 --> 00:20:09,458
Because roaches like them
don't have the right

323
00:20:09,541 --> 00:20:14,963
to socialize with a crown prince like you.

324
00:20:21,970 --> 00:20:24,556
[grunting] Drink up, my son. Drink up.

325
00:20:27,351 --> 00:20:29,353
[tense music playing]

326
00:20:32,064 --> 00:20:33,649
-[ice clinking]
-[whiffs]

327
00:20:36,151 --> 00:20:37,152
I shouldn't.

328
00:20:43,700 --> 00:20:46,245
[tense music playing]

329
00:20:56,338 --> 00:20:58,340
Do you still want to track
down the pickup?

330
00:20:59,341 --> 00:21:01,677
We need to find the pickup, Agent Salonga.

331
00:21:01,760 --> 00:21:05,514
And I don't get why your partner
refuses to cooperate with me!

332
00:21:05,597 --> 00:21:08,934
[sighs] You mean Jude?
I'll take care of it.

333
00:21:09,518 --> 00:21:11,103
I'll bring my men to the scene.

334
00:21:12,145 --> 00:21:13,105
You know what?

335
00:21:13,188 --> 00:21:16,483
Why don't you just report him
to your superior?

336
00:21:17,025 --> 00:21:19,569
Or maybe have him investigated?

337
00:21:19,653 --> 00:21:21,947
You don't want to have someone
like him in your agency.

338
00:21:22,406 --> 00:21:24,950
He might drag everyone down.

339
00:21:27,619 --> 00:21:29,204
[slow tense music playing]

340
00:21:36,378 --> 00:21:37,796
[footsteps approaching]

341
00:22:03,071 --> 00:22:05,240
<i>We've retrieved the</i>
<i>pickup truck that rescued her.</i>

342
00:22:05,324 --> 00:22:06,450
<i>It's been secured downstairs.</i>

343
00:22:10,871 --> 00:22:12,664
[suspenseful music playing]

344
00:22:47,824 --> 00:22:52,829
[suspenseful music intensifies]

345
00:22:59,169 --> 00:23:01,213
-You're seriously suspecting me?
-[folio slaps against table]

346
00:23:01,797 --> 00:23:05,759
Do you actually think
I helped Red Dragon escape?!

347
00:23:07,427 --> 00:23:13,517
[chuckling] Wow! Take
it easy, Agent Asuncion.

348
00:23:14,226 --> 00:23:16,394
I never said you're working for
Red Dragon. You just did!

349
00:23:16,478 --> 00:23:19,064
All because I don't want
to look for that darn pickup?!

350
00:23:19,773 --> 00:23:21,483
-Jude!
-And why is that?

351
00:23:21,566 --> 00:23:24,986
Why are you hiding it?
Or are you covering for someone?

352
00:23:29,074 --> 00:23:32,577
If I were you, Agent Salonga,
I'd be careful.

353
00:23:32,661 --> 00:23:36,414
You saw how your friend reacted.

354
00:23:37,582 --> 00:23:41,545
Watch your back because if
my suspicions prove true,

355
00:23:41,628 --> 00:23:44,297
there's a snake among us.

356
00:23:48,009 --> 00:23:50,220
[Lily] Keep me posted, Agent Salonga.

357
00:23:51,054 --> 00:23:52,973
That woman's unbelievable.

358
00:23:53,807 --> 00:23:57,477
She keeps meddling in our affairs.
She has no boundaries.

359
00:23:58,061 --> 00:24:01,273
[tense music playing]

360
00:24:07,362 --> 00:24:11,241
Okay. I'll be expecting you. Bye.

361
00:24:16,997 --> 00:24:20,542
Madam Emilia, Mr. Ramon Lim of the north.

362
00:24:21,042 --> 00:24:22,043
Perfect.

363
00:24:23,503 --> 00:24:25,964
-[Emilia] Mr. Ramon Lim.
-Hello! Hello!

364
00:24:26,047 --> 00:24:28,425
Nice to meet you. I am Emilia.

365
00:24:28,508 --> 00:24:30,552
-[Ramon] Emilia.
-[Emilia] Have a seat, please.

366
00:24:30,635 --> 00:24:31,428
Hold on.

367
00:24:32,304 --> 00:24:34,347
I thought all four of us would be here.

368
00:24:34,431 --> 00:24:37,309
Where are the others? Why is it just us?

369
00:24:37,392 --> 00:24:40,145
Relax, Mr. Ramon Lim of the north.

370
00:24:40,228 --> 00:24:44,482
Oscar Evangelista, Carlos Isidro,
and Salvador Victoria

371
00:24:44,566 --> 00:24:46,193
will be arriving in a short while,

372
00:24:46,276 --> 00:24:50,238
so, in the meantime,
please make yourself comfortable

373
00:24:50,322 --> 00:24:51,990
and let us bond.

374
00:24:52,073 --> 00:24:55,785
I wanna get to know you, Mr. Lim.
Have a seat, please.

375
00:24:57,829 --> 00:24:59,247
Mr. Lim.

376
00:24:59,331 --> 00:25:03,710
Oh, Mercedes! Mercedes, how are you?

377
00:25:03,793 --> 00:25:05,295
[Mercedes] I'm good.
It's good to see you, sir.

378
00:25:05,378 --> 00:25:06,379
[Ramon] You look very nice!

379
00:25:06,463 --> 00:25:09,049
-Thank you very much. So do you.
-You look very good.

380
00:25:09,132 --> 00:25:10,008
Okay.

381
00:25:10,091 --> 00:25:12,677
Enough with the pleasantries.
This isn't a reunion.

382
00:25:12,761 --> 00:25:16,473
We're here to talk about
Red Dragon's disappearance,

383
00:25:16,556 --> 00:25:19,267
and whether you had anything
to do with it, Mr. Lim.

384
00:25:19,351 --> 00:25:21,853
False alarm! False alarm!

385
00:25:21,937 --> 00:25:24,356
I don't know anything about that.

386
00:25:24,981 --> 00:25:29,653
Why don't you ask
the others coming? Not me.

387
00:25:30,612 --> 00:25:32,614
[tense music playing]

388
00:25:37,118 --> 00:25:39,788
Don't tell me you believe that Lily Cruz?

389
00:25:41,373 --> 00:25:43,166
I asked our men to look for the pickup.

390
00:25:43,792 --> 00:25:47,128
That's the only way
we can prove your innocence.

391
00:25:49,089 --> 00:25:50,465
I need to go.

392
00:25:51,466 --> 00:25:52,717
Where are you going?

393
00:25:53,260 --> 00:25:56,304
Jude, you need to answer
those allegations.

394
00:25:58,014 --> 00:26:00,725
Stop right there, Agent Jude Asuncion.

395
00:26:02,686 --> 00:26:05,772
The pickup that attacked us
while Red Dragon was escaping

396
00:26:06,398 --> 00:26:09,317
is registered under
one of your businesses.

397
00:26:09,401 --> 00:26:11,861
[tense music playing]

398
00:26:14,948 --> 00:26:17,200
<i>We've retrieved the pickup truck</i>
<i>that rescued her.</i>

399
00:26:17,284 --> 00:26:18,868
<i>It's been secured downstairs.</i>

400
00:26:23,331 --> 00:26:26,251
<i>Boss, we found the owner of the plate.</i>

401
00:26:28,586 --> 00:26:29,754
<i>Thank you, boss.</i>

402
00:26:33,425 --> 00:26:34,968
<i>-Good afternoon, sir.</i>
<i>-Hi.</i>

403
00:26:35,468 --> 00:26:39,931
<i>Sir, these are the packages</i>
<i>you can choose from.</i>

404
00:26:40,015 --> 00:26:42,600
<i>When are you planning</i>
<i>to hold your seminar?</i>

405
00:26:42,684 --> 00:26:44,436
<i>Our management is still deciding on it.</i>

406
00:26:45,020 --> 00:26:47,772
<i>-Hmm.</i>
<i>-This is a nice place.</i>

407
00:26:48,315 --> 00:26:51,109
<i>-It is.</i>
<i>-Who owns it?</i>

408
00:26:51,192 --> 00:26:52,444
<i>The Asuncions.</i>

409
00:26:52,527 --> 00:26:55,739
<i>Mrs. Connie Asuncion manages the business.</i>

410
00:26:57,782 --> 00:26:59,451
<i>Would you like some coffee, sir?</i>

411
00:26:59,534 --> 00:27:02,203
<i>-Sure.</i>
<i>-Hold on. I'll bring you a cup.</i>

412
00:27:03,663 --> 00:27:05,665
[suspenseful music playing]

413
00:27:08,168 --> 00:27:10,628
Does the name <i>Connie Asuncion </i>ring a bell?

414
00:27:14,090 --> 00:27:14,966
It should.

415
00:27:15,050 --> 00:27:20,388
Because I found out your mother
owns an events company.

416
00:27:20,472 --> 00:27:22,682
An events company that owns
a particular pickup truck.

417
00:27:22,766 --> 00:27:25,727
Are you still insisting
that you're innocent?

418
00:27:27,979 --> 00:27:30,857
[suspenseful music continues]

419
00:27:31,649 --> 00:27:35,695
You helped Red Dragon escape.

420
00:27:37,447 --> 00:27:39,949
[suspenseful music intensifies]

421
00:27:48,666 --> 00:27:49,959
[tense music playing]

422
00:27:50,335 --> 00:27:51,544
-Jude!
-Hey!

423
00:27:51,628 --> 00:27:53,046
[women screaming]

424
00:27:53,338 --> 00:27:55,173
-Asuncion--
-Jude!

425
00:28:03,139 --> 00:28:03,890
Asuncion!

426
00:28:03,973 --> 00:28:05,016
[cocks gun]

427
00:28:05,642 --> 00:28:06,643
Jude!

428
00:28:06,726 --> 00:28:07,560
My gun!

429
00:28:07,644 --> 00:28:09,521
-Men, go after him!
-Yes, sir!

430
00:28:09,938 --> 00:28:10,688
[cocks gun]

431
00:28:16,277 --> 00:28:17,737
[gunshots]

432
00:28:29,833 --> 00:28:31,084
[grunting]

433
00:28:33,461 --> 00:28:35,463
[tense music playing]

434
00:28:54,107 --> 00:28:55,608
[consecutive gunshots]

435
00:29:04,576 --> 00:29:07,620
[triumphant music playing]

436
00:29:14,753 --> 00:29:18,047
You aren't going to hell
just yet, Asuncion.

437
00:29:21,593 --> 00:29:24,137
You still have a lot of explaining to do.

438
00:29:29,559 --> 00:29:32,896
-Men, arrest him.
-Yes, sir.

439
00:29:49,120 --> 00:29:51,122
[tense music intensifies]

440
00:29:53,917 --> 00:29:57,170
So… Any more visitors?

441
00:29:57,629 --> 00:30:00,799
Or as usual, are you just
sitting on your hands?

442
00:30:03,426 --> 00:30:05,428
You might be Red Dragon's daughter,

443
00:30:06,221 --> 00:30:08,139
but I'm the one the Big Four recognizes.

444
00:30:10,308 --> 00:30:11,351
Still think you can win?

445
00:30:16,314 --> 00:30:17,732
[scoffs]

446
00:30:18,274 --> 00:30:19,776
[footsteps approaching]

447
00:30:22,821 --> 00:30:26,199
Madam, Oscar Evangelista of the south.

448
00:30:27,575 --> 00:30:30,286
Oscar Evangelista, godfather of the south.

449
00:30:30,829 --> 00:30:31,913
Emilia.

450
00:30:33,081 --> 00:30:37,418
[giggles] Nice to finally meet you, Oscar.

451
00:30:37,502 --> 00:30:39,379
Thank you for your time.
Have a seat, please.

452
00:30:43,633 --> 00:30:46,469
Can I offer you anything? Scotch? Wine?

453
00:30:48,888 --> 00:30:50,723
Maybe later. I'm with someone.

454
00:30:52,350 --> 00:30:55,770
Oh. All right. [exhales]

455
00:30:56,938 --> 00:30:57,939
Here she is.

456
00:30:58,481 --> 00:31:01,067
Well… Hello, ladies.

457
00:31:01,150 --> 00:31:03,444
[Oscar] Yeah. This is Natalie.

458
00:31:03,528 --> 00:31:04,445
I know her.

459
00:31:04,529 --> 00:31:07,574
-[chuckles]
-[stammers] So, you are…

460
00:31:08,116 --> 00:31:09,325
[Emilia laughs] Oh!

461
00:31:09,409 --> 00:31:12,787
[Natalie] Yes, we're together.
We are a pair.

462
00:31:13,246 --> 00:31:18,459
You look shocked, Emilia.
I told you, didn't I?

463
00:31:18,543 --> 00:31:21,170
I'll do whatever it takes to get in.

464
00:31:21,838 --> 00:31:25,133
-[giggles]
-So, what did it take?

465
00:31:25,216 --> 00:31:29,721
-Spreading your legs?
-[both laugh]

466
00:31:29,804 --> 00:31:32,473
No. I just bent over.

467
00:31:32,765 --> 00:31:35,143
That easy. [chuckles]

468
00:31:36,019 --> 00:31:38,396
And because of my lovey-dovey,

469
00:31:39,063 --> 00:31:43,860
I am now the queen
of the syndicate in the south,

470
00:31:44,110 --> 00:31:46,029
while you two…

471
00:31:47,488 --> 00:31:51,951
are fighting over your mother's leftovers.

472
00:31:52,368 --> 00:31:56,873
[chuckles] And right now,
I'm so thrilled to be here.

473
00:31:57,248 --> 00:32:01,210
I can't wait to hear how you're
going to convince my lovey-dovey

474
00:32:01,294 --> 00:32:02,879
to get on your side.

475
00:32:03,338 --> 00:32:04,505
[mouthing]<i> Lovey-dovey.</i>

476
00:32:04,589 --> 00:32:10,261
[chuckles] And I'm so excited
to make you eat your words.

477
00:32:12,639 --> 00:32:14,641
[huffs] Have a seat, please.

478
00:32:15,433 --> 00:32:16,643
Gladly.

479
00:32:18,269 --> 00:32:22,273
[tense music playing]

480
00:32:24,233 --> 00:32:25,526
[Emilia huffing]

481
00:32:28,696 --> 00:32:29,656
Sit!

482
00:32:32,450 --> 00:32:34,911
This won't take long, Agent Asuncion.

483
00:32:36,955 --> 00:32:41,834
We're just going to ask you
where your boss is hiding.

484
00:32:44,837 --> 00:32:47,423
-Where is Red Dragon?!
-I don't know!

485
00:32:47,507 --> 00:32:49,384
[tense music playing]

486
00:32:50,969 --> 00:32:53,638
Agent Salonga, aren't you
going to do anything?

487
00:32:55,390 --> 00:32:58,893
You know what to do
to make someone talk, right?

488
00:32:58,977 --> 00:33:00,853
You don't know where Red Dragon is?

489
00:33:01,562 --> 00:33:03,481
I said I don't! [grunts]

490
00:33:03,564 --> 00:33:05,775
[Jude sputtering]

491
00:33:08,236 --> 00:33:09,487
[coughs]

492
00:33:10,697 --> 00:33:12,615
Let's do this the easy way…

493
00:33:13,533 --> 00:33:17,328
unless you want to do it the hard way.

494
00:33:18,579 --> 00:33:20,206
You work for Red Dragon, right?

495
00:33:20,873 --> 00:33:25,837
Are you part of the group
that helped Red Dragon escape?

496
00:33:26,337 --> 00:33:27,714
[breathes deeply]

497
00:33:27,964 --> 00:33:31,676
Jude, just admit it!
We're trying to help you!

498
00:33:32,635 --> 00:33:34,470
No matter how much you hurt me…

499
00:33:35,263 --> 00:33:38,182
you won't get anything
because I'm telling the truth!

500
00:33:39,684 --> 00:33:43,938
I am not part of Red Dragon's syndicate!

501
00:33:44,272 --> 00:33:45,606
You're telling the truth?

502
00:33:46,858 --> 00:33:48,693
You're telling the truth?!

503
00:33:48,776 --> 00:33:51,279
Look into my eyes
and tell me that you are--

504
00:33:51,362 --> 00:33:53,698
-Yes!
-[slaps, thuds]

505
00:33:57,452 --> 00:33:58,995
[tense music playing]

506
00:34:15,845 --> 00:34:17,180
[Emilia] Carlos Isidro of the west,

507
00:34:17,263 --> 00:34:20,933
Silverio Victoria of the east,
Ramon Lim of the north,

508
00:34:21,976 --> 00:34:25,438
Oscar Evangelista of the south,
we are complete.

509
00:34:25,605 --> 00:34:29,233
So, since it's clear
to all of us that none of you

510
00:34:29,317 --> 00:34:31,319
helped my mother escape, not Mercedes…

511
00:34:31,402 --> 00:34:33,154
Certainly, not me.

512
00:34:36,532 --> 00:34:37,575
[hat slaps against table]

513
00:34:37,658 --> 00:34:39,660
If you didn't help Red Dragon escape,

514
00:34:39,744 --> 00:34:43,164
or you, or you, or me, then who did?!

515
00:34:47,210 --> 00:34:49,378
It's possible that it's one
of Madam's connections

516
00:34:49,462 --> 00:34:51,047
that we have yet to meet.

517
00:34:51,422 --> 00:34:54,759
And only Mama can answer
your questions right now.

518
00:34:56,719 --> 00:34:59,097
You know, I think we should
move on with this discussion.

519
00:34:59,180 --> 00:35:02,391
Shouldn't we be talking about
who's going to replace

520
00:35:02,475 --> 00:35:04,894
Red Dragon while she's gone?

521
00:35:05,812 --> 00:35:09,148
[clears throat] Oscar,
it's quite obvious that I

522
00:35:09,232 --> 00:35:11,651
should take Red Dragon's place,

523
00:35:11,734 --> 00:35:13,486
since I'm her only daughter.

524
00:35:15,947 --> 00:35:19,325
Why should we do that?
Did she contact you?

525
00:35:25,414 --> 00:35:27,500
Why don't we have an election?

526
00:35:29,335 --> 00:35:33,589
Emilia versus me
for Red Dragon's position.

527
00:35:36,634 --> 00:35:40,346
I agree. That sounds so interesting.

528
00:35:40,930 --> 00:35:46,686
Who will inherit the wings
and the scales of Red Dragon?

529
00:35:47,270 --> 00:35:48,312
[Natalie] Hmm…

530
00:35:48,688 --> 00:35:53,025
Is it the high and mighty daughter?

531
00:35:53,442 --> 00:35:56,696
Or is it the fire-breathing protégé?

532
00:35:57,321 --> 00:36:00,283
I wonder… I'm going to watch this.

533
00:36:04,120 --> 00:36:07,123
[tense music playing]

534
00:36:16,841 --> 00:36:17,884
[suspenseful music playing]

535
00:36:17,967 --> 00:36:20,052
[Lily] <i>Agent Asuncion</i>
<i>doesn't want to talk.</i>

536
00:36:20,136 --> 00:36:22,054
He says he doesn't work for Red Dragon.

537
00:36:22,638 --> 00:36:24,640
I'll find out if he's telling the truth.

538
00:36:26,017 --> 00:36:27,185
Thank you.

539
00:36:29,395 --> 00:36:30,438
[phone locks]

540
00:36:31,689 --> 00:36:33,232
I have a bad feeling about this, Lily.

541
00:36:33,774 --> 00:36:36,110
It's impossible that Jude
is working for Red Dragon.

542
00:36:36,194 --> 00:36:39,405
I know he's your friend,
but don't let that blind you.

543
00:36:39,947 --> 00:36:43,075
The people you trust
can be the same people

544
00:36:43,159 --> 00:36:47,914
who'll stab you in the back
when you least expect them to.

545
00:36:47,997 --> 00:36:49,874
So open your eyes, Noel.

546
00:36:57,506 --> 00:36:59,425
[suspenseful music playing]

547
00:37:16,776 --> 00:37:18,778
[papers shuffling]

548
00:37:41,634 --> 00:37:43,469
-Is this it?
-Yes, ma'am.

549
00:37:46,097 --> 00:37:49,267
[slow tense music playing]

550
00:37:53,729 --> 00:37:54,563
[scoffs]

551
00:37:56,857 --> 00:37:58,234
Fifty million?

552
00:38:01,946 --> 00:38:03,864
Wake your friend up.

553
00:38:06,075 --> 00:38:09,453
Jude. Jude. Jude.

554
00:38:09,537 --> 00:38:10,413
[gasps]

555
00:38:10,496 --> 00:38:12,123
Agent Jude Asuncion!

556
00:38:15,209 --> 00:38:16,752
Well, you're right.

557
00:38:17,712 --> 00:38:19,422
Someone told me

558
00:38:19,505 --> 00:38:22,758
that it is impossible
that you work for Red Dragon.

559
00:38:23,634 --> 00:38:26,554
[scoffing] Then what are you waiting for?

560
00:38:26,637 --> 00:38:28,472
Untie me now!

561
00:38:28,556 --> 00:38:30,308
[ominous music playing]

562
00:38:31,684 --> 00:38:34,770
Then again, I'm not stupid.

563
00:38:34,854 --> 00:38:37,398
[Lily] I don't believe things that easily.

564
00:38:38,065 --> 00:38:40,109
If you're not with Red Dragon,

565
00:38:41,819 --> 00:38:46,240
then you work for another group
that helped her escape.

566
00:38:48,034 --> 00:38:49,076
Don't you?

567
00:38:50,411 --> 00:38:51,662
Don't you?!

568
00:38:55,291 --> 00:38:57,460
I got your bank account records.

569
00:38:58,669 --> 00:39:01,213
Looks like you're a wealthy man,
Jude Asuncion.

570
00:39:01,297 --> 00:39:06,344
You received fifty million pesos
just to help her escape.

571
00:39:08,804 --> 00:39:10,056
Now tell me…

572
00:39:11,098 --> 00:39:15,478
Who do you really work for?
Who is your boss?

573
00:39:20,149 --> 00:39:22,151
[stammers] No matter what you do…

574
00:39:25,404 --> 00:39:27,865
you can't stop Red Dragon…

575
00:39:31,118 --> 00:39:33,746
because she's already left the country.

576
00:39:35,664 --> 00:39:37,792
Red Dragon left the Philippines?

577
00:39:38,167 --> 00:39:39,418
To go where?

578
00:39:40,252 --> 00:39:42,380
Where is Red Dragon?!

579
00:39:42,463 --> 00:39:43,506
Tell me!

580
00:39:44,340 --> 00:39:45,216
Where?!

581
00:39:45,299 --> 00:39:47,718
I'm not the one you should be torturing!

582
00:39:47,802 --> 00:39:49,428
[Lily] Then who?!

583
00:39:50,179 --> 00:39:53,265
I served 10 years in this job! [quivers]

584
00:39:53,349 --> 00:39:56,268
I just did this to earn money
for my child!

585
00:39:56,352 --> 00:39:58,687
You know that, Noel! You know that!

586
00:40:01,857 --> 00:40:04,610
There are people out there worse than me!

587
00:40:04,693 --> 00:40:08,614
Go after them, not me!
I'm not a bad person!

588
00:40:11,075 --> 00:40:15,204
But you still helped a big-time
crime lord escape.

589
00:40:17,456 --> 00:40:19,125
As the saying goes,

590
00:40:20,209 --> 00:40:22,962
"Regrets always come in the end."

591
00:40:23,879 --> 00:40:25,548
Do you know what will happen to you now?

592
00:40:26,173 --> 00:40:30,678
You will be imprisoned.
Your reputation will be ruined.

593
00:40:31,178 --> 00:40:35,349
And the money that you received?
It will rot just like you will.

594
00:40:37,435 --> 00:40:41,063
But if you'll confess, I'll help you out.

595
00:40:41,564 --> 00:40:43,941
[Lily] Your friend and I will help you.

596
00:40:46,193 --> 00:40:47,445
Jude Asuncion,

597
00:40:49,697 --> 00:40:51,824
will you cooperate with us?

598
00:40:54,535 --> 00:40:56,454
You won't be able to help me.

599
00:40:58,664 --> 00:41:02,168
Because you don't know what I need!

600
00:41:02,251 --> 00:41:04,920
-That's not--
-Jude! Jude, stop!

601
00:41:05,004 --> 00:41:06,589
Jude! Jude!

602
00:41:07,214 --> 00:41:08,340
[gunshot]

603
00:41:11,302 --> 00:41:12,303
[grunting]

604
00:41:15,973 --> 00:41:17,016
[Jude sputtering]

605
00:41:18,350 --> 00:41:20,519
[dramatic music playing]

606
00:41:20,853 --> 00:41:22,021
[Jude coughing]

607
00:41:24,273 --> 00:41:25,858
[sobs]

608
00:41:27,485 --> 00:41:29,487
[Jude coughing]

609
00:41:31,864 --> 00:41:34,325
[Jude gasping]

610
00:41:38,913 --> 00:41:41,916
[brooding music playing]

611
00:41:47,254 --> 00:41:48,881
[door opening]

612
00:41:54,803 --> 00:41:56,263
Jude is now in the hospital.

613
00:41:57,890 --> 00:41:59,016
I'm sorry.

614
00:42:01,393 --> 00:42:02,478
How is he?

615
00:42:04,647 --> 00:42:05,773
He's in critical condition.

616
00:42:08,400 --> 00:42:11,695
But don't worry. The minute he wakes up,

617
00:42:12,029 --> 00:42:15,241
I won't stop interrogating him
until I get the truth.

618
00:42:17,618 --> 00:42:18,619
Thank you.

619
00:42:30,798 --> 00:42:33,759
No matter which country you hide in…

620
00:42:33,842 --> 00:42:35,594
I'll find you, Red Dragon.

621
00:42:36,845 --> 00:42:38,931
Justice will be served…

622
00:42:39,348 --> 00:42:44,144
I'll free Diego from your clutches.

623
00:42:48,774 --> 00:42:51,777
[suspenseful music playing]

624
00:43:06,125 --> 00:43:08,002
[man speaking Chinese] Boss, your phone.

625
00:43:08,085 --> 00:43:09,545
[Helena speaking Chinese] Thank you.

626
00:43:14,550 --> 00:43:17,553
[charged music playing]

627
00:43:27,605 --> 00:43:29,857
Ha! An election?

628
00:43:31,650 --> 00:43:35,070
Pack your bags, Emilia.
You're going to lose.

629
00:43:35,738 --> 00:43:39,199
Well, thank you, Papa,
for your astounding support.

630
00:43:39,283 --> 00:43:40,826
I really appreciate it.

631
00:43:41,243 --> 00:43:45,706
Come on! I'm not trying
to piss you off, okay?

632
00:43:45,789 --> 00:43:50,002
I'm just telling you the truth.
If they decide to vote on it,

633
00:43:50,085 --> 00:43:54,048
you'll surely lose, because two
members of the Big Four…

634
00:43:54,131 --> 00:43:58,469
who you've talked to will
definitely vote for Mercedes.

635
00:43:58,969 --> 00:44:04,933
Now, the third one, he couldn't care less.

636
00:44:05,267 --> 00:44:09,355
He doesn't care who wins,
as long as he's still there.

637
00:44:09,772 --> 00:44:13,651
The fourth one…
Since the two men have already

638
00:44:13,734 --> 00:44:16,612
voted for Mercedes, he wouldn't
waste his vote on you.

639
00:44:16,904 --> 00:44:20,824
He might as well join the other
two by voting for Mercedes.

640
00:44:20,908 --> 00:44:22,993
So, you see? You'll lose.

641
00:44:24,119 --> 00:44:26,330
You're really happy
seeing me like this, huh?

642
00:44:26,580 --> 00:44:28,874
No, I'm just telling you the truth.

643
00:44:29,333 --> 00:44:31,418
You and I, we're the same.

644
00:44:31,835 --> 00:44:34,880
We have this insatiable hunger for power.

645
00:44:34,963 --> 00:44:36,632
We're never satisfied.

646
00:44:36,715 --> 00:44:39,510
We want to keep acquiring
more… more power.

647
00:44:39,593 --> 00:44:41,679
-So, you see, we're the same.
-No, Papa.

648
00:44:41,762 --> 00:44:43,722
I beg to disagree. We're not the same

649
00:44:43,806 --> 00:44:47,267
because although you've already
acquired power as governor,

650
00:44:47,768 --> 00:44:51,563
you still love seeing the people
around you living in misery.

651
00:44:52,064 --> 00:44:56,235
You know what I think, Papa?
You're not power hungry…

652
00:44:56,610 --> 00:44:57,903
you're just simply <i>evil.</i>

653
00:44:58,404 --> 00:45:00,531
Ouch. That hurts.

654
00:45:01,240 --> 00:45:02,116
Come on.

655
00:45:02,699 --> 00:45:04,118
I am not evil.

656
00:45:04,785 --> 00:45:08,288
I just know how to look out
for number one.

657
00:45:08,997 --> 00:45:11,959
When everything goes up in
flames and the smoke clears,

658
00:45:12,918 --> 00:45:14,962
you will see that I'm still on top.

659
00:45:15,045 --> 00:45:18,841
You know why? All my life,
I've taken care of three people.

660
00:45:18,924 --> 00:45:22,511
Three people who make sure that
I will always remain on top.

661
00:45:22,594 --> 00:45:23,512
You know who they are?

662
00:45:25,013 --> 00:45:27,641
I, me, and myself.

663
00:45:28,851 --> 00:45:30,894
-[Julio laughing hysterically]
-[huffs]

664
00:45:31,520 --> 00:45:34,356
Well, enjoy your lunch.

665
00:45:35,649 --> 00:45:36,608
<i>Enjoy.</i>

666
00:45:36,942 --> 00:45:38,485
I'm leaving you. Ah…

667
00:45:39,361 --> 00:45:44,950
I will be in my room…
wallowing in victory.

668
00:45:45,033 --> 00:45:47,327
[Julio laughing]

669
00:45:47,953 --> 00:45:49,955
[Julio humming]

670
00:45:52,458 --> 00:45:53,542
[Julio] King!

671
00:45:54,918 --> 00:45:56,170
[phone ringing]

672
00:46:00,090 --> 00:46:01,592
[phone ringing]

673
00:46:05,512 --> 00:46:06,305
Hello?

674
00:46:06,805 --> 00:46:07,764
Baby girl?

675
00:46:08,098 --> 00:46:09,641
Mama, where are you?

676
00:46:09,975 --> 00:46:13,729
High up, overlooking a fabulous city.

677
00:46:14,688 --> 00:46:17,858
I called because I have
something important to tell you.

678
00:46:21,778 --> 00:46:27,242
While Mama Dragon is away,
I want my baby dragon to slay.

679
00:46:29,411 --> 00:46:31,997
Baby dragon? What are you talking about?

680
00:46:32,080 --> 00:46:35,667
It's time for you to test
your wings and prepare to fly.

681
00:46:35,751 --> 00:46:37,920
Since you're a dragon's daughter,

682
00:46:38,003 --> 00:46:39,588
I want you to learn…

683
00:46:39,671 --> 00:46:42,257
<i>how to breathe fire while I'm away.</i>

684
00:46:42,841 --> 00:46:44,968
Yes, my baby dragon.

685
00:46:46,136 --> 00:46:50,974
You're going to be
the organization's leader.

686
00:46:53,685 --> 00:46:57,356
And I want you to burn them all.

687
00:46:58,607 --> 00:46:59,733
[chuckles]

688
00:46:59,816 --> 00:47:01,985
Me?! You want me to…

689
00:47:02,069 --> 00:47:04,404
-<i>take your place, Mama?</i>
-But of course, baby girl.

690
00:47:04,488 --> 00:47:08,575
So, please. Make your Mama dragon proud.

691
00:47:09,826 --> 00:47:10,869
Of course.

692
00:47:12,037 --> 00:47:13,914
[Emilia] <i>Um, Mama…</i>

693
00:47:13,997 --> 00:47:16,416
Who helped you escape
and when are you coming back?

694
00:47:16,500 --> 00:47:18,001
All you need to know right now

695
00:47:18,085 --> 00:47:22,422
is that I'm having a golden moment
in a fantastic city.

696
00:47:23,549 --> 00:47:27,344
And don't worry about me, okay?

697
00:47:28,303 --> 00:47:29,179
Mm…

698
00:47:29,805 --> 00:47:33,016
Okay. Um, Mama?

699
00:47:33,850 --> 00:47:35,269
Yes, baby girl?

700
00:47:35,811 --> 00:47:38,522
I just wanna thank you
for believing in me.

701
00:47:38,605 --> 00:47:41,984
<i>I thought you didn't believe in me</i>
<i>just like Papa doesn't.</i>

702
00:47:42,484 --> 00:47:45,028
And I thought you didn't love me, either.

703
00:47:45,529 --> 00:47:47,364
But of course I love you!

704
00:47:47,447 --> 00:47:50,242
Emilia, I'm doing all this for you.

705
00:47:50,325 --> 00:47:56,540
So go test your wings
and protect Mama's kingdom.

706
00:47:56,623 --> 00:47:58,458
[chuckles] Yes.

707
00:47:59,585 --> 00:48:03,589
[suspenseful music playing]

708
00:48:08,468 --> 00:48:12,222
Hmph! Now, it's my time to shine.

709
00:48:12,723 --> 00:48:14,224
Look out, Papa.

710
00:48:15,309 --> 00:48:18,937
The queen is back. [laughs]

711
00:48:19,938 --> 00:48:21,023
Love it!

712
00:48:24,526 --> 00:48:25,527
[moans]

713
00:48:30,407 --> 00:48:33,410
[suspenseful music playing]

714
00:48:39,875 --> 00:48:42,377
[Lily] <i>I have a spy within</i>
<i>Red Dragon's organization.</i>

715
00:48:42,461 --> 00:48:45,005
<i>We can keep track of their every move.</i>

716
00:48:45,088 --> 00:48:48,550
[Romulo] <i>Once I prove that</i>
<i>Torillo's a spy, I'll kill him.</i>

717
00:48:48,634 --> 00:48:51,637
[Emilia] <i>I'll be taking her</i>
<i>place while she's away.</i>

718
00:48:51,720 --> 00:48:54,890
[Noel] <i>If we catch the Big Four</i>
<i>and Emilia Ardiente…</i>

719
00:48:54,973 --> 00:48:56,642
<i>it will be our biggest arrest.</i>

720
00:48:56,725 --> 00:48:59,394
<i>I'd rather die than kneel before you.</i>

721
00:48:59,936 --> 00:49:02,773
[Emilia]<i>I know I can do this</i>
<i>and I know what I'm doing!</i>

722
00:49:03,565 --> 00:49:06,109
[Mercedes] <i>We're cut from the</i>
<i>same cloth, Lily Cruz.</i>

723
00:49:06,193 --> 00:49:08,070
<i>Are you going to join my group…</i>

724
00:49:08,153 --> 00:49:12,282
<i>or do you want to play second</i>
<i>fiddle to Emilia forever?</i>

725
00:49:12,366 --> 00:49:15,327
[theme music playing]
